    <briefdescription>
<para>Fetches and parses XML sitemaps into URL lists. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Injectable fetch function allows tests to supply sitemap XML without any network I/O. The default fetch function is <computeroutput>nullptr</computeroutput> (must be set via <computeroutput>ScraperPlugin::setSitemapCrawler()</computeroutput> or the constructor) except when the <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1scraper_1_1_scraper_plugin" kindref="compound">ScraperPlugin</ref></computeroutput> supplies the HTTP fetch at runtime. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
